1. DP (TOP DOWN) : T.C. - O(N), S.C. - O(N)

APPROACH: calculating max of (dfs(1) + nums[0] + dfs(2)) that means comparing 1 with other elements but comparing max with 
(nums[0] + DFS(i+2) thats after leaving one block in between.

class Solution:
    def rob(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:

        memo = [-1] * len(nums)

        def dfs(i):
            if i >= len(nums):
                return 0
            if memo[i] != -1:
                return memo[i]
            memo[i] = max(dfs(i+1), nums[i] + dfs(i+2))
            return memo[i]

        return dfs(0)
                

        
